      <title>南航B-20C5波音777在上海虹桥误放应急滑梯 损失或超10万元</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/%E5%8D%97%E8%88%AAB-20C5%E6%B3%A2%E9%9F%B3777%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%99%B9%E6%A1%A5%E8%AF%AF%E6%94%BE%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A5%E6%BB%91%E6%A2%AF-%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E6%88%96%E8%B6%8510%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83/</link>
